# {{ project_name }} — generated by Neviri-Ansi

Infrastructure: **{{ _meta.name }}** (v{{ _meta.version }}, PCI: {{ _meta.pci }}) · environment: **{{ env }}**

An S3 **data lake** (raw + curated zones) with an AWS **Glue** crawler and ETL
job. Once the crawler runs, the catalog is query-ready in **Athena**.

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Region | `{{ aws_region }}` |
| Raw bucket | `{{ bucket_prefix }}-raw` |
| Curated bucket | `{{ bucket_prefix }}-curated` |
| Glue database | `{{ glue_database | default('analytics_db') }}` |

## Run
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install ansible boto3 botocore
ansible-galaxy collection install -r collections/requirements.yml
aws configure                                   # credentials for {{ aws_region }}

ansible-playbook preflight.yml                  # checks creds + variables
ansible-playbook site.yml --check               # dry run
ansible-playbook site.yml                        # provision the lake + Glue
```

After provisioning: drop data into the raw bucket, run the crawler, upload your
ETL script to `s3://{{ bucket_prefix }}-curated/scripts/etl.py`, then query the
`{{ glue_database | default('analytics_db') }}` database from Athena.
